    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Product URL to CGI Commercial\n\n**Product URL to CGI Commercial** inspects a product page and produces a studio tabletop packshot and an animated commercial take.\n\n1. **Product URL**, **Visual Style**, and **Camera Move** feed into **Agent** (with browser access) to write a material-accurate packshot prompt.\n2. **TextToImage** renders the hero product keyframe and **ImageToVideo** executes the camera move."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": -220
        },
        "width": 720,
        "height": 170
      },
      {
        "id": "product_url",
        "type": "nodetool.input.StringInput",
        "data": {
          "name": "product_url",
          "value": "https://nodetool.ai",
          "description": "Product landing page URL to inspect.",
          "line_mode": "single_line"
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 40
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "visual_style",
        "type": "nodetool.input.StringInput",
        "data": {
          "name": "visual_style",
          "value": "Macro tabletop commercial on dark brushed slate, warm amber rim lighting, crisp specular highlights, 85mm cinema lens",
          "description": "Lighting, surface materials, and optical treatment.",
          "line_mode": "multi_line"
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "camera_move",
        "type": "nodetool.input.SelectInput",
        "data": {
          "name": "camera_move",
          "value": "360 orbit",
          "options": [
            "360 orbit",
            "orbit left",
            "orbit right",
            "slow push in",
            "dolly in",
            "crane up",
            "low-angle hero rise",
            "pull back reveal",
            "through-object pass"
          ],
          "enum_type_name": "camera_move",
          "description": "Camera trajectory for the commercial shot."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 380
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "brief",
        "type": "nodetool.text.Prompt",
        "data": {
          "template": "Open {{ url }} and inspect the product's visual form, materials, colours, and hero positioning.\n\nWrite a single detailed studio photography and CGI commercial prompt for this product in the following visual style: {{ style }}, framed for a {{ move }} camera move.\n\nReturn ONLY the visual prompt paragraph."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 380,
          "y": 140
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "commercial_director",
        "type": "nodetool.agents.Agent",
        "data": {
          "model": {
            "type": "language_model",
            "provider": "",
            "id": "",
            "name": "",
            "path": null
          },
          "system": "You are a commercial tabletop director. Inspect the product URL with the browser tool and return a single visual prompt describing the product, materials, and lighting.",
          "tools": [
            {
              "type": "tool_name",
              "name": "browser"
            },
            {
              "type": "tool_name",
              "name": "web_search"
            }
          ],
